      en: ["Angel Island processed an estimated massive one million immigrants, primarily from massive Asian countries.", "It was heavily massive designed to enforce the massive racist provisions of the massive Chinese Exclusion Act.", "Some massive immigrants were detained in massive incredibly harsh conditions for massive months or even massive years awaiting processing.", "Detainees carved massive hundreds of incredibly moving massive classical Chinese poems directly into the massive wooden massive barrack walls.", "The massive main administration building tragically massive burned down in 1940, leading to the massive facility's closure.", "The massive site was nearly massive demolished in the 1970s before a massive community effort saved the massive poetry-covered massive barracks."]
